  "title": "Passive immunotherapies for the next influenza pandemic",
  "crossref_title": "Passive immunotherapies for the next influenza pandemic",
  "abstract": "Influenzavirus is among the most relevant candidates for a next pandemic. We review here the phylogeny of former influenza pandemics, and discuss candidate lineages. After briefly reviewing the other existing antiviral options, we discuss in detail the evidences supporting the efficacy of passive immunotherapies against influenzavirus, with a focus on convalescent plasma.",
